<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width"/><title>Privacy — SEO Researcher</title><meta name="description" content="SEO Researcher privacy information."/><link rel="canonical" href="https://seoresearcher.ai/privacy"/><link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg"/></head><body><main class="shell legal"><a href="/">← SEO Researcher</a><h1>Privacy</h1><p>Last updated: September 1, 2026</p><h2>What we process</h2><p>We process account details, authentication data, research requests, source URLs, usage events, and service diagnostics needed to provide and improve SEO Researcher.</p><h2>How we use it</h2><p>We use this information to run requested research, secure accounts, support billing, measure reliability and adoption, prevent abuse, and improve the product.</p><h2>Service providers</h2><p>SEO Researcher uses shared Rankability infrastructure and service providers for hosting, payments, authentication, analytics, monitoring, and research execution. We do not sell personal information.</p><h2>Your choices</h2><p>You may disconnect an authorized agent, revoke API credentials, cancel the service, or request access or deletion through support.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>Email <a href="mailto:support@seoresearcher.ai">support@seoresearcher.ai</a>.</p></main></body></html><style>.legal{max-width:760px;padding-block:4rem}.legal>a{font-weight:800}.legal h1{font-size:clamp(3rem,8vw,5rem);margin:3rem 0 1rem}.legal h2{margin-top:2rem}.legal p{color:var(--muted)}</style>
